<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-22 grain exports at 389,848 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-22 grain exports at 389,848 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen totalled 389,848 tonnes between January 1 and January 22, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 418,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>The 389,848 tonnes included 258,783 tonnes of wheat and 131,065 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   36,071</p>
<p>    Algeria			 45,500</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		13,100</p>
<p>    Cuba			    23,141</p>
<p>    Britain			 10,560</p>
<p>    Greece			   5,500</p>
<p>    Ireland			  3,010</p>
<p>    Italy			  104,401</p>
<p>    Morocco			 10,500</p>
<p>    Turkey			   7,000</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		 106,611</p>
<p>    China			   22,000</p>
<p>    Italy			    2,454</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
